  "description": "BambooHR work-anniversary + birthday branded emails via SES. Daily CronJob (13:30 UTC) in namespace bamboohr-anniversary-mailer on mzla-workloads. Runbook: platform-infrastructure/services/bamboohr-anniversary-mailer/README.md",
