      "description": "Most recent run, both occasions combined: employees whose anniversary or birthday was that day, emails sent, skips because the S3 ledger already had a receipt, sends with no manager CC, and skips for a missing work email. Most days are 0/0/0: cross-check the CronJob panel to tell a quiet day from a dead job.",
